    <article class="machine__card rv"><p class="machine__n">Bobcat + truck</p><h3 class="machine__h">Skid steer & tipper</h3><p class="machine__p">Bobcat loads spoil, truck carts it. One crew, one mobilisation - the side-access workhorse.</p></article>
    <article class="machine__card rv"><p class="machine__n">Posi track</p><h3 class="machine__h">Tracked skid steer</h3><p class="machine__p">Low ground pressure, climbs where wheels spin. Soft ground, wet sites, finished levels without tracking mud.</p></article>
    <article class="machine__card rv"><p class="machine__n">Excavator + truck</p><h3 class="machine__h">Digger & tipper pair</h3><p class="machine__p">3t-5t excavator loads, 6w/8w tipper hauls. Bulk spoil out, VENM/ENM in - single mobilisation.</p></article>
